# Nalu design baseline

Follow the "Approved Nalu design — always preserve" section of the repository's AGENTS.md for every change and release.
The approved web design is the baseline for all future work, including AI/backend-only work.
Start from the combined release history, preserve functional live workspace behavior, and use the checked deployment workflow.
Never reintroduce an older UI, preview-only functionality, the production preview banner, or the removed blue scene overlay.
Coordinate a single production publisher and verify the actual public domains after publication.
